              <circle cx="110" cy="65" r="6" fill="var(--accent-vermilion)" />
              <circle cx="45" cy="30" r="4" fill="var(--accent-terracotta)" />
              <circle cx="178" cy="36" r="4" fill="var(--accent-terracotta)" />
              <circle cx="62" cy="104" r="3.5" fill="var(--text-secondary)" />
              <circle cx="168" cy="98" r="3.5" fill="var(--text-secondary)" />
              <text x="82" y="84" font-family="'IBM Plex Mono', monospace" font-size="8" fill="var(--text-primary)">ACTIVE NOTE</text>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="backlinks-list">
            <div class="pane-Subheader mono-label">LINKED MENTIONS</div>
            <div class="backlink-card">
              <strong class="mono-label">Anatomia Mentis.md</strong>
              <p>...why [[On Fleeting Ideas]] requires &lt;380ms cold capture...</p>
            </div>
            <div class="backlink-card">
              <strong class="mono-label">Vault Sync Topology.md</strong>
              <p>...BLAKE3 manifest hash verified across desktop &amp; mobile...</p>
            </div>
          </div>
